          "source_id": "s-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness-ws2118581",
          "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003",
          "quote": "典筆吏取筆不如意，鞭五十。子倩，尚文帝第四女海鹽公主。初，始興王濬以潘妃之寵，故得出入後宮，遂與公主私通。及適倩，倩入宮而怒，肆詈搏擊，引絕帳帶。事上聞，有詔離婚，殺主所生蔣美人，伯符慚懼發病卒。諡曰肅。傳國至孫勗，齊受禪，國除。",
          "subject_person_reference_id": "c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003:r0083",
          "object_person_reference_id": "c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003:r0086"
        }
      ],
      "status": "source_attested",
      "interpretation_note": "所生指生母，蔣為生母，無其本名。",
      "reviewer": "Codex（AI代理）",
      "model": null,
      "human_reviewed": false
